Z||000006||Ken Wittlief||10-31-2001||09:40 AM||||when I was a kid back in buffalo some kids went out on the night before halloween for candy - we called it beggars night.<P>I heard there was a little town in pennsylvaina, in the NE corner of the state, and kids use to decend on the town on the night before halloween and totally trash the place.<P> I dont know how it started or why this one little town got picked on, but it got pretty  bad after a few years till the state police started showing up in LARGE numbers and put and end to it.||||reg||10
